  neqfix (apartup) qblocksapartup.side
  (apartdown): N, tau, sigma, a, b, s, t, zB, zT in NN>=1, y, pN, ptau, psig, pa, pb, ps, pt in QQ>0, pN + 1 = y^(2 * N), ptau + 1 = y^(2 * tau), psig + 1 = y^(2 * sigma), pa + 1 = y^(2 * a), pb + 1 = y^(2 * b), ps + 1 = y^(2 * s), pt + 1 = y^(2 * t), N = s + sigma, tau = N + t, y = zB * (a * b * tau * s) + zT * (a * b * sigma * t) + 1 : zT * y^(N + tau + s) * (pa * pb * psig * pt) < zB * y^(N + sigma + t) * (pa * pb * ptau * ps)
